FFmpeg master 30fff47764e5 (2026-10-20), not in release/9.0 after 9.0.2;
CVE-2026-125180:
https://github.com/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/commit/30fff47764e59f02ac7868bb832ed51a88f949fd

EXIF: the value bytes of an IFD tree are bounded by the size of the buffer;
many entries that point at one overlapping payload made the allocations grow
quadratically, gigabytes from a small EXIF block in a JPEG, PNG or WebP picture
(or in the frames of an MJPEG video).

